@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Hiragino Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ranksep 15
skinparam nodesep 20
skinparam ArrowColor #506776
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #486477
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #F0F6F8
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #F5F2E9
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8E9
skinparam dpi 170
rectangle "業務側の記述\n型・純粋計算・操作の合成" as business
rectangle "結果の意味\nConsequence / Conclusion" as outcome
rectangle "受付と実行の管理\nJob / Task・容量制御" as job
rectangle "個々の操作と確定\nインタープリタ / UoW" as uow
rectangle "実際の入出力\nProvider / 保存 / 配送" as provider
business -down-> job : Job受付
business -right-> uow : 直接実行
job -down-> uow : Taskと実行文脈
uow -down-> provider : 認可後に実行
provider -up-> uow : 応答
uow -right-> outcome : 終了を含む結果と失敗
outcome -up-> business : 意味を保って返す
note left of job
応答・受付・負荷を管理
end note
note left of uow
確定・終了を管理
end note

@enduml
